  "bodyHash": "MrkIYVp6t9k=",
  "content": "<h2><strong>關於</strong></h2><p>Arts &amp; Crafts 主要添加了各種獨特的建築方塊，可供在創意模式和生存模式世界中使用！本模組由 KekeCreations 和 Arbeet 製作！我們將會持續更新至新版本！</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1034791/description_da9cd1cd-65a6-4193-85ee-55c3bba1a3d3.png\"></p><h2><strong>相容性</strong></h2><p><strong>Arts &amp; Crafts V1.3.0</strong> 設有<strong>可停用功能的設定選項</strong>，可關閉需要大量相容性調整的功能，例如染色花盆或染色裝飾陶罐。</p><p><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><strong>在 Arts &amp; Crafts V1.3.0 中，染色裝飾陶罐現已支援所有陶片！</strong></span></p><p><strong>若您需要不同模組與 Arts &amp; Crafts 的相容性</strong>，可下載 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/artsandcrafts-compatibility\" rel=\"nofollow\">Arts &amp; Crafts 相容性擴充</a>！</p><p>若想在您的模組中添加畫筆相容性，請參考<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fkekecreations.boomla.net%252fmods%252fminecraft-java-edition%252farts-and-crafts\" rel=\"nofollow\">我的網站</a>上的說明文件！                                                                                                                         <br>&nbsp; <img style=\"float:right\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1034791/description_b38592c3-a7cc-4fe8-a654-a38e70f9214e.png\"><br><br></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1034791/description_46654742-e7f0-4eeb-a776-1897f1625b2f.png\"></p><h2><strong>功能特色</strong></h2><h2><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1034791/description_da5b20ee-a039-4ea8-8816-66dfa7577fc0.png\"><br></strong></h2><p>若想了解本模組功能的詳細資訊，請查看<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fkekecreations.boomla.net%252fmods%252fminecraft-java-edition%252farts-and-crafts\" rel=\"nofollow\">此處的維基頁面</a>！</p><ol>\n<li>粉筆</li>\n<li>粉筆條</li>\n<li>軟木</li>\n<li>染色陶罐</li>\n<li>石膏</li>\n<li>蓮花</li>\n<li>畫筆</li>\n<li>彩繪泥磚</li>\n<li>灰泥</li>\n<li>屋瓦</li>\n<li>皂石</li>\n</ol><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1034791/description_6b87bc64-2f00-4f70-9c04-94fb99d2fbf7.png\"></p><h2>特別感謝</h2><ul>\n<li>特別感謝&nbsp;<strong>ExDrill</strong>&nbsp;製作畫筆繪畫音效並設置畫筆資料包相關內容！[<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fx.com%252fExDrill_\" rel=\"nofollow\">Twitter</a>]</li>\n<li>感謝 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fx.com%252fOther_Goblin\" rel=\"nofollow\">Pixel Goblin</a> 建議加入彩繪泥磚！</li>\n<li>感謝 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fx.com%252fThatJadenXgamer\" rel=\"nofollow\">JadenXGamer</a> 製作自訂皂石與軟木音效！</li>\n<li>特別感謝 <a href=\"https://github.com/Iamnotagenius\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Iamnotagenius</a> 允許我使用其 Fabric 設定程式碼！<br><br><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fx.com%252fCreationsKeke\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1034791/description_1c7c6ef7-e88e-4f20-bb69-5db02edebb00.png\"></a><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbsky.app%252fprofile%252fariana-bit.bsky.social\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1034791/description_0e75891e-bc9e-4760-bfce-803c7a732b42.png\"></a><br><br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1034791/description_46654742-e7f0-4eeb-a776-1897f1625b2f.png\"></li>\n</ul>",
